    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dooxada Lafaha Engegan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gacantii Rabbiga ayaa i dul saarnayd, oo Ruuxiisuu kor iigu qaaday, oo igu dhex riday dooxo ay lafo ka buuxaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo hareerahooda ayuu igu wareejiyey, oo bal eega, waxaa dooxada bannaankeeda yiil lafo aad iyo aad u tiro badan, oo bal eega, aad iyo aad bay u qallalnaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu igu yidhi, Wiilka Aadamow, lafahanu miyey noolaan karaan? Oo waxaan ugu jawaabay: Sayidow, Rabbiyow, adaa og. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana wuxuu igu yidhi, Lafahan la hadal, oo waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, Lafahan engeganow, bal erayga Rabbiga maqla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu lafahan ku leeyahay, Bal eega, neef baan idin gelin doonaa, oo idinku waad noolaan doontaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo seedaan idin kor saari doonaa, oo hilib baan idiin yeeli doonaa, oo harag baan idinku dabooli doonaa, oo neef baan idin gelin doonaa, oo waad noolaan doontaan, oo waxaad ogaan doontaan inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas darteed ayaan wax u sii sheegay sidii laygu amray, oo intaan wax sii sheegayay ayaa sanqadh weyni yeedhay, oo dhulgariir baa dhacay, oo lafihiina way isku soo wada urureen, oo lafuba lafteedii bay u tagtay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo intaan fiirinayay ayaa waxaa soo kor fuulay seedo, oo hilib baana ka dul baxay oo harag baa ku kor daboolmay, laakiinse neefu kuma jirin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu igu yidhi, Wiilka Aadamow, dabaysha la hadal, la hadal, oo waxaad dabaysha ku tidhaahdaa, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Dabayshay, afarta qalbadood ka kaalay oo kuwan la laayay si ay u soo noolaadaan aawadeed ku neefso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed waxaan ku hadlay siduu igu amray, oo neef baa iyagii soo gashay, oo way soo wada noolaadeen, oo cagahay ku istaageen, oo waxay ahaayeen ciidan aad iyo aad u faro badan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu igu yidhi, Wiilka Aadamow, lafahanu waa reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan. Bal eeg, iyagu waxay yidhaahdaan, Lafahayagii way engegeen, oo rajadayadiina way go'day, oo waannu wada baabba'nay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed hadal oo waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Dadkaygow, bal eega, qabuurihiinnaan wada furi doonaa, oo qabuurihiinnaan idinka soo bixin doonaa, waxaanan idin keeni doonaa dalkii reer binu Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dadkaygow, markaan qabuurihiinna wada furo, oo aan qabuurihiinna idinka soo bixiyo, waxaad ogaan doontaan inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruuxaygaan idin gelin doonaa, waanad soo noolaan doontaan, oo waxaan idin keeni doonaa dalkiinnii. Oo markaasaad ogaan doontaan in aniga Rabbiga ahu aan saas ku hadlay, oo aan weliba oofiyey, ayaa Rabbigu leeyahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Quruun Qudha Iyo Boqor Qudha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, ul soo qaad, oo waxaad ku qortaa: Tanu waxay u tahay reer Yahuudah iyo reer binu Israa'iil oo saaxiibbadiis ah. Oo haddana ul kale soo qaad, oo waxaad ku qortaa: Tanu waxay u tahay reer Yuusuf taasoo ah ushii Efrayim, iyo reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan oo saaxiibbadiis ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo labadoodaba isku dar oo waxaad isaga dhigtaa ul qudha inay iyagu gacantaada isku mid qudha ku noqdaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markay dadkaagu kula hadlaan oo ay kugu yidhaahdaan, War, maad noo sheegtid waxa aad xaalkan ula jeeddid? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal eega, waxaan soo qaadan doonaa usha reer Yuusuf oo gacanta reer Efrayim ku jirta, iyo qabiilooyinka reer binu Israa'iil oo isaga saaxiibbadiis ah, oo waxaan ku dari doonaa usha reer Yahuudah, oo kulligood waxaan isaga wada dhigi doonaa ul qudha oo gacantayday ku midoobi doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo ulaha aad waxaas ku qortana waa inay gacantaada ku jiraan iyagoo indhaha ku haya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaad iyaga ku tidhaahdaa, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal ogaada, reer binu Israa'iil waan ka soo dhex bixin doonaa quruumaha ay tageen, oo intaan dhinac kasta ka soo ururiyo ayaan dalkoodii keeni doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyaga quruun qudha ayaan uga dhigi doonaa dalka buuraha reer binu Israa'iil, oo boqor qudha ayaa kulligood boqor u wada ahaan doona, oo mar dambe laba quruumood ma ay kala ahaan doonaan, oo kol dambe innaba laba boqortooyo uma ay kala qaybsanaan doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo mar dambena iskuma ay nijaasayn doonaan sanamyadooda, ama waxyaalahooda karaahiyada ah, ama xadgudubyadooda midkoodna, laakiinse waxaan ka badbaadin doonaa meelaha ay ku hoydaan oo ay ku dhex dembaabeen oo dhan, oo waan nadiifin doonaa, oo sidaasay dadkayga u ahaan doonaan, oo aniguna Ilaahooda baan ahaan doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo addoonkaygii Daa'uud ayaa iyaga boqor u ahaan doona, oo kulligoodna waxay lahaan doonaan adhijir qudha; oo weliba xukummadayday ku dhex socon doonaan, oo qaynuunnadaydana way dhawri doonaan oo way wada samayn doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay dhex degganaan doonaan dalkii aan addoonkaygii Yacquub siiyey, oo ay awowayaashiin degganaan jireen, oo weligoodba halkaasay degganaan doonaan iyaga iyo carruurtooda, iyo carruurtooda carruurtooduba, oo addoonkaygii Daa'uudna weligiis amiirkoodii buu ahaan doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba axdi nabdeed baan la dhigan doonaa, oo kaasu wuxuu ahaan doonaa axdi daa'imis ah oo weligoodba iyaga lala dhigtay. Oo iyagaan barakayn doonaa, waanan sii badin doonaa, oo meeshayda quduuska ahna weligeedba waan dhex dhigi doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo taambuuggayguna iyaguu la jiri doonaa, oo Ilaahoodaan ahaan doonaa, oo iyaguna dadkaygay ahaan doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo quruumuhuna waxay ogaan doonaan in aniga Rabbiga ahu aan reer binu Israa'iil quduus ka dhigo, markii meeshayda quduuska ahu ay weligeedba dhexdooda ku sii taallo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
